<title>BULGARIA: Yield flat on Bulgaria 4-wk discount T-bills.</title>
<headline>Yield flat on Bulgaria 4-wk discount T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yield was flat at Bulgaria's Finance Ministry daily auction of four-week discount T-bills on Friday as the issue was oversubscribed, a central bank official said.</p>
<p>The average yield to maturity on the issue was 3.81 percent, unchanged from Thursday and up from 3.80 percent at Wednesday's auction.</p>
<p>Details of the issue follow. Prices in percent of par:</p>
<p> Issue number		  BG3036797002</p>
<p> Maturity			four weeks</p>
<p> Par value		     26,000 million levs</p>
<p> Issue date		    June 2</p>
<p> Maturity date		 June 30</p>
<p> Bids received		 34,593.5 million levs</p>
<p> Avg price of bids	   96.32 pct</p>
<p> Bids approved		 26,000 million levs</p>
<p> Avg accepted price	  96.33 pct</p>
<p> Avg yield to maturity     3.81 pct</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
